/**
 * Reserved private IPs — a supported way for hand-built infra VMs (which have no
 * Server row and may be stopped, so neither the DB nor ARP shows them) to hold
 * an address IPAM must never hand out.
 *
 * Stored in the `Setting` key `ipam.reserved_ips`, one entry per line:
